{"type":"FeatureCollection","city":{"id":"mount-carmel","name":"Mount Carmel","center":[31.596,-96.9885],"zoom":17,"radiusKm":1.2,"wiki":"Mount Carmel Center","view3d":true,"style3d":"colonial","ambience":"countryside","summary":["New Mount Carmel was a 77-acre farm on the prairie near Elk, 13 miles north-east of Waco. The Davidians moved here in 1957; by 1993 about 130 Branch Davidians lived in one large timber building their leader David Koresh had them build in 1988 to 1990.","It was the scene of the ATF raid on 28 February 1993, the 51-day FBI siege that followed, and the fire of 19 April in which 76 people died. The ruins were bulldozed two weeks later. A small chapel and memorials stand on the site today."],"note":"The building's layout is approximate: drawn round its surviving foundations and pool (OpenStreetMap) after descriptions of Matthew Wittmer's 1999 scale model and the FBI's account of 19 April. Turned to match the foundations, front to the south-south-east, tower front-centre, chapel and gymnasium at the east end.","osmCredit":"Foundations, pool, roads and memorials (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL"},"features":[
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"old-houses","kind":"houses","name":"Mount Carmel settlement","from":"1957","to":"1989","description":["The Davidians who moved here in 1957 lived in small frame houses scattered over the farm, with an administration building and a printing press. Koresh's followers pulled most of them down and reused the timber for one large building."],"fabric":{"style":"colonial","mix":{"clapboard":0.55,"garden":0.45}}},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-96.988783,31.595205],[-96.987518,31.595853],[-96.988115,31.5967],[-96.989381,31.596052],[-96.988783,31.595205]]]}},
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"front-quarters","kind":"building","name":"Living quarters","from":"1989","to":"1993-04-20","description":["Two storeys of rooms along the front of the building, built by the members themselves from salvaged lumber. Women and children lived on one side, men on the other; Koresh's room and the armoury were on the second floor."],"model":{"type":"house","h":7.5,"colour":"#d9d1bf","roof":"#7d776d"}},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-96.988605,31.595736],[-96.988108,31.595991],[-96.988173,31.596083],[-96.98867,31.595829],[-96.988605,31.595736]]]}},
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"west-wing","kind":"building","name":"West wing","from":"1989","to":"1993-04-20","description":"More living quarters, running back from the front along the west side.","model":{"type":"house","h":7,"colour":"#d9d1bf","roof":"#7d776d"}},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-96.98867,31.595829],[-96.988552,31.595889],[-96.988694,31.596089],[-96.988811,31.596029],[-96.98867,31.595829]]]}},
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"tower","kind":"building","name":"Central tower","from":"1989","to":"1993-04-20","description":["A four-storey timber tower at the centre of the front, used as a lookout and for living space. During the siege the FBI warned the Davidians to keep out of it; on 18 April children were held up at its windows."],"model":{"type":"house","h":14,"colour":"#e2dccd","roof":"#6e6a63"},"labelZoom":17},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-96.988263,31.595932],[-96.988136,31.595997],[-96.988245,31.596151],[-96.988372,31.596086],[-96.988263,31.595932]]]}},
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"kitchen","kind":"building","name":"Kitchen and cafeteria","from":"1989","to":"1993-04-20","description":"The communal kitchen and dining room, behind the tower under a sloping roof.","model":{"type":"house","h":4.5,"colour":"#cfc6b2","roof":"#7d776d"}},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-96.98839,31.596077],[-96.988227,31.59616],[-96.988336,31.596314],[-96.988498,31.596231],[-96.98839,31.596077]]]}},
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"chapel","kind":"building","name":"Chapel","from":"1989","to":"1993-04-20","description":["The chapel where Koresh preached for hours at a time. On 28 February ATF agents set ladders against its roof to reach the second-floor windows of the armoury."],"model":{"type":"house","h":8.5,"colour":"#d4cbb6","roof":"#6e6a63"}},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-96.988108,31.595991],[-96.987945,31.596074],[-96.988043,31.596213],[-96.988205,31.59613],[-96.988108,31.595991]]]}},
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"gym","kind":"building","name":"Gymnasium","from":"1989","to":"1993-04-20","description":["A tall warehouse-like hall behind the chapel, used as a gym and for storage. On 19 April an armoured vehicle broke through the rear wall near it, and part of its roof came down before the fire."],"model":{"type":"house","h":9,"colour":"#c9c0ab","roof":"#7d776d"}},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-96.988205,31.59613],[-96.988043,31.596213],[-96.988173,31.596398],[-96.988336,31.596314],[-96.988205,31.59613]]]}},
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"water-tower","kind":"building","name":"Water tower","from":"1989","to":"1993-04-20","model":{"type":"extrude","h":12,"colour":"#a8a49b","roof":"#8e8a82"},"showLabel":false},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-96.988806,31.596074],[-96.988752,31.596102],[-96.988784,31.596148],[-96.988838,31.59612],[-96.988806,31.596074]]]}},
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"pit","kind":"harbour","name":"Construction pit","from":"1992","description":["A concrete pit dug in 1992 for a swimming pool, partly filled with water. On the morning of 19 April an FBI agent fired three pyrotechnic tear gas rounds at it; the FBI denied this until 1999. The pit is still there."],"labelZoom":17},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-96.987984,31.596284],[-96.987837,31.596048],[-96.987736,31.596098],[-96.9879,31.596325],[-96.987984,31.596284]]]}},
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"vault","kind":"building","name":"Concrete vault","from":"1989","description":["A concrete storage room at the foot of the tower, the only part of the building that was not wood. After the fire many of the women and children were found inside it."],"model":{"type":"extrude","h":2.6,"colour":"#a7a39a","roof":"#99958c"},"labelZoom":18},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-96.98828,31.596118],[-96.988324,31.596095],[-96.988278,31.596031],[-96.988234,31.596054],[-96.98828,31.596118]]]}},
